              "weight": 1,
              "result": "小偷把你引向丧尸群，你受到了{damage}点伤害。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.health", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [5, 34], "token": "damage"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "你闯进了对方的营地，被抢走{coins}枚金币并受到{damage}点伤害。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.coins", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [1, 36], "token": "coins"},
                {"target": "player.health", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [40, 60], "token": "damage"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "你在超市堵住了他们，带回一批补给：药品、金币、属性与零件各+25，饥饿值-25，活跃度+20。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.medical_supplies", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "medical_supplies"},
                {"target": "player.coins", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "coins"},
                {"target": "player.attack", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "attack"},
                {"target": "player.defense", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "defense"},
                {"target": "player.agility", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "agility"},
                {"target": "player.parts", "operation": "add", "amount": 25, "token": "parts"},
                {"target": "player.hunger", "operation": "subtract", "amount": 25, "token": "hunger"},
                {"target": "shelter.activity", "operation": "add", "amount": 20, "token": "activity"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "你踩中了他们留下的陷阱，受到{damage}点伤害。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.health", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [5, 25], "token": "damage"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ignore",
          "label": "穷寇莫追",
          "result": "你记下这条路线，优先保证自己安全。",
          "effects": []
        },
        {
          "id": "scavenge",
          "label": "在附近搜索物资",
          "result": "你没有追赶，而是在附近找到{parts}个可用零件。",
          "effects": [
            {"target": "player.parts", "operation": "add", "amount": [3, 12], "token": "parts"}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trade_route_ambush",
      "category": "ambush",
      "weight": 1,
      "title": "断桥伏击",
      "intro": "前往交易点的旧高架被临时路障封死，戴着焊接面罩的人从废车后包围了车队。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "resolve",
          "label": "设法脱身",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "weight": 2,
              "result": "你提前发现了路障后的反光，带队绕过断桥，所有物资都保住了。",
              "effects": []
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "你用{coins}枚金币换来一条撤离通道，交易只能取消。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.coins", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [4, 12], "token": "coins", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "交火只持续了几十秒，你仍被流弹擦伤，生命-{damage}。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.health", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [3, 8], "token": "damage", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "撤退时一个工具箱坠下高架，丢失{parts}个零件。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.parts", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [2, 6], "token": "parts", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "掩护队伍穿过车阵时，装粮袋被划破，丢失{food}份食物。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.food", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [3, 8], "token": "food", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "伏击者夺走了急救包，损失{medical_supplies}份医疗用品。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.medical_supplies", "operation": "subtract", "amount": [2, 5], "token": "medical_supplies", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            },
            {
              "weight": 1,
              "result": "阳关从废车底追回{coins}枚赃款，但避难所听见交火录音后希望值下降{hope}点。",
              "effects": [
                {"target": "player.coins", "operation": "add", "amount": [3, 9], "token": "coins"},
                {"target": "shelter.hope", "operation": "subtract", "amount": 2, "token": "hope", "limit_to_available": true}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
